					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-730972#post-1917464</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-730972/scp-2001-j#post-1917464</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 17 Dec 2013 22:06:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Salman Corbette</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>678987</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Butt laser, I get it, har har, but there is 0 effort put into this -J. No punchline, no humorous juxtaposition (with the exception of the last addendum), no observational cleverness. Where's the bit about butt ghost unsheathing his butt laser and telling the pooper he is their father? Where's the incident report about a guy farting in a house of mirrors, causing tons of casualties? Where's the guy who ended up having a hoarde of cats following behind him? This is a lazy excuse for a -J, and I am disappointed. You can do better than this, SCP.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
